Diddy Kong Racing VR source patch

Base: https://github.com/akratch/goldenballoon
Tag: v1.7.0
Commit: 106bad37244a2f8829bab21c655d25ff4b4dcdbf

Apply from a clean checkout of that commit:
    git apply --binary dkr64-v1.7.0-vr.patch

Windows 1.7.0 preview source. Flat and VR builds and 26 selected checks
passed before this source publication. Synthetic headset captures cover
stereo, view modes, the HUD and Rice-format texture replacements. Direct
headset review and the actual community pack remain pending. The carried
Android source has not been qualified against 1.7.0.

Existing-file changes use Git binary hunks; added text files remain readable.
This is a source patch, not an executable or a patch for an installed game.
Upstream licensing and third-party notices remain applicable; preserve
LICENSE, NOTICE.md and THIRD_PARTY.md from the pinned base.

