index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..25679040b957704b11aa9c84f778759570cf8284
--- /dev/null
+++ b/tests/input_scripts/nav_to_vr_menu.txt
@@ -0,0 +1,38 @@
+# DKR: TITLE -> one-player Tracks race -> PAUSE -> VR OPTIONS page.
+#
+# The frontend route is the proven nav_to_time_trial_race fixture. Mid-race,
+# pause and walk down to the VR OPTIONS row (appended after SELECT CHARACTER
+# when a VR session is live; the fake rig counts), open it, move to the
+# WORLD SIZE row and nudge it twice. A panel dump while the page is open is
+# the machine proof the page renders and reacts.
+
+# Title -> Character Select
+1250 START 4
+1330 START 4
+1450 A 4
+1540 A 4
+# Caution -> Game Select -> Tracks
+1750 A 4
+1900 DOWN 4
+2000 A 4
+# Ancient Lake, car, Time Trial off, GO
+2150 A 4
+2320 A 4
+2460 A 4
+2600 A 4
+
+# Pause. One-player Tracks rows: 0 CONTINUE, 1 RESTART RACE, 2 SELECT TRACK,
+# 3 SELECT CHARACTER, 4 VR OPTIONS, 5 QUIT GAME.
+4000 START 4
+4060 DOWN 4
+4110 DOWN 4
+4160 DOWN 4
+4210 DOWN 4
+4270 A 4
+
+# Inside the VR page: down to WORLD SIZE, nudge it smaller twice.
+4360 DOWN 4
